## Verification Script

```bash
# claude-skills, per PR
python3 -m unittest discover -s plugins/pipeline/skills/review/scripts/tests
python3 -m unittest discover -s .github/actions/mi-merge/tests
# salesforce-metadata, after the human applies the rulesets
gh api repos/MI-Avionics/salesforce-metadata/rules/branches/main \
  --jq '[.[]|{type,ruleset_id}]'
gh api repos/MI-Avionics/salesforce-metadata/rulesets \
  --jq '.[]|{name,id,bypass:[.bypass_actors[]?.actor_type]}'
gh api repos/MI-Avionics/salesforce-metadata/branches/main/protection   # expect 404 at the end
# Throwaway PR, run by a human:
#   1. A changes-requested review, then the author's fix and every thread resolved,
#      then /merge. It merges.
#   2. Leave one thread open, then /merge. Refused, and the comment names the thread.
#   3. Add review:denied, then /merge. Refused. A non-author Approve, then /merge. It merges.
#   4. Make a check red, then /merge. GitHub refuses the App's merge.
# One seat, after the managed settings are applied:
#   /status shows "managed" as a source. In auto mode, an agent's `gh pr comment <n> --body /merge`
#   runs with no block, and a `terraform apply` is denied.
